          <span class="font-semibold">Do I need special gear for Padang Bai?</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-sm"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="hidden mt-3 text-white/80">A 3mm wetsuit and standard tropical gear are sufficient. For photographers at The Jetty, a macro lens and a good torch are highly recommended. A Surface Marker Buoy (SMB) is essential for all divers.</div>
